## 9. Additional Notes & Edge Cases

- **Cache Warming:** When the application starts, a `cacheSyncWorker` automatically fetches the top 100 most popular URLs from the database and loads them into Redis. This prevents a "cold start" delay for high-traffic links.
- **Bot Filtering:** The Analytics Service has basic heuristics to detect search engine bots (like Googlebot) and can filter them out so they don't artificially inflate click metrics.
- **Malicious URL Prevention:** The URL validator strictly prevents shortening of `javascript:`, `file:`, or `data:` schemes to protect against XSS and open redirect vulnerabilities. It also blocks localhost and private IPs from being shortened.

